<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.pool.opens ~ open ~ the editor line, and no workspace file

`lares surface open` prints `<editor> -n` over the face's root and its realm pools and writes no workspace file. The editor reads from the house config tiddler `$:/config/lares/surface/Editor`, else `code`; `--launch` runs the line. A face with no root yet refuses until `surface init` lays it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ print · launch

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`print` params=`~ print the editor line`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`launch` params=`launch/true ~ run the editor line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · launch

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`launch` params=`~ run the editor line instead of printing it alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ launches a host editor; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ surface-no-pool · surface-editor-absent · surface-launch-failed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-no-pool` params=`cure/[[face.pool.lays]] ~ the face holds no root yet`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-editor-absent` params=`~ this machine holds no such editor; name one in the config tiddler`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-launch-failed` params=`~ the editor line answered a non-zero exit`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ printed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`printed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[face argv editor launched exit]] ~ the line, and its exit where launched`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

